.TH GETSID 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
getsid \- returns a process session id; process zero selects the caller
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <unistd.h>
.B pid_t getsid(pid_t process);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Returns a process session ID; process zero selects the caller.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result on success, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR getsid (2)
